'''Øvre Romerike''' is the upper (northern) half of the traditional [[Norway|Norwegian]] district [[Romerike]]. It consists of the [[Akershus]] municipalities [[Gjerdrum]], [[Nannestad]], [[Eidsvoll]], [[Hurdal]], [[Ullensaker]] and [[Nes, Akershus|Nes]]. The lower (southern) portion is known as [[Nedre Romerike]].
